  m_Name: Shroom
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CreatureData
  creatureName: 'Mushtink '
  description: "A colony of sentient fungi that buries itself into the soil and scares
    passerbies by jumping out of the dirt. I still don\u2019t know if it does this
    as a defense mechanism or because it finds it amusing, either way, this habit
    makes its \u201Clegs\u201D very strong and with a pungent odor."
  note: "Note from Luc\xEDa: I hate these guys. They\u2019re not dangerous or even
    scary-looking, but they constantly jump-scare me while looking for other critters!"
  family: 1
  favoriteScent: 2
  hatedScent: 4
